msgid "`.env` (gitignored) is generated by `make dotenv`, which delegates to `python -m cli.meta.env`. It combines `default.env` with runtime-resolved values (selected distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived cache sizes, sha256 secrets, repository owner, ...). Each line in `.env` is preceded by its own comment, so the file is self-describing. Open it after `make dotenv` to inspect the effective value-set together with its documentation."
